sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client · GET /bff/search
    participant R as FedGQL Router
    participant S as search subgraph
    participant PR as product subgraph
    participant PN as pnp subgraph
    participant I as inventory subgraph
    C->>R: query SearchAndCheckStorePrices (supergraph-query.graphql)
    R->>S: searchProducts(query, filters)
    S-->>R: SearchResponse { totalCount, hits [Product {sku}] }
    par hydrate the hits in parallel
        R->>PR: _entities([{__typename: Product, sku}]) · title, brand
        PR-->>R: Product fields merged by @key(sku)
    and
        R->>PN: _entities([{__typename: Product, sku}]) · storeContext(storeId)
        PN-->>R: ProductStoreContext { sku, storeId, price }
    end
    R->>I: _entities([{__typename: ProductStoreContext, sku, storeId}]) · inventoryCount
    I-->>R: inventoryCount merged by @key(sku storeId)
    R-->>C: one JSON payload
